{"id":553,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"While terribly aggressive, Krookodile also has the patience to stay hidden under sand for days, lying in wait for prey."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon is known as the Bully of the Sands. Krookodile’s mighty jaws can bite through heavy plates of iron with almost no effort at all."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It conceals itself in sandstorms that Flygon whip up and waits patiently for prey to appear."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"When it spots prey, even at a distance of over 30 miles, it swims through the desert as if it were water, then jumps out and chomps them."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"After clamping down with its powerful jaws, it twists its body around to rip its prey in half."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its unique faculty of sight can detect small prey more than 30 miles away, even in the midst of a sandstorm."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Black"],"text":"They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes."},{"games":["White"],"text":"It can expand the focus of its eyes, enabling it to see objects in the far distance as if it were using binoculars."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Moxie","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon knocks out a target, it shows moxie, which boosts its Attack stat."},{"name":"Anger Point","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon is angered when it takes a critical hit, and that maxes its Attack stat."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":551,"name":"Sandile","condition":null,"children":[{"id":552,"name":"Krokorok","condition":"Lv. 29","children":[{"id":553,"name":"Krookodile","condition":"Lv. 40","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,28],[1,43],[1,468],[1,681],[9,328],[12,184],[15,44],[18,259],[21,91],[24,207],[27,242],[32,201],[35,492],[44,89],[51,37],[58,200]],"machine":[332,34,784,280,339,523,370,242,174,399,91,38,337,406,525,414,89,283,203,263,424,374,411,264,492,416,447,441,270,667,63,282,808,67,490,341,189,200,182,156,46,157,317,328,201,799,184,815,421,806,214,188,479,555,180,446,707,444,164,36,269,851,168,675,422],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-137","name":"Krookodile","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"137","artist":"Uninori","img":"zsv10pt5/137"},{"id":"me4-55","name":"Krookodile ex","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"55","artist":"5ban Graphics","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-55/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-55/large"},{"id":"me2-66","name":"Krookodile","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"66","artist":"Ryuta Fuse","img":"me2/66"},{"id":"zsv10pt5-59","name":"Krookodile","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"59","artist":"Gapao","img":"zsv10pt5/59"},{"id":"sv1-117","name":"Krookodile","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"117","artist":"Misa Tsutsui","img":"sv1/117"},{"id":"swsh12-113","name":"Krookodile","set":"Silver Tempest","date":"2022-11-11","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"113","artist":"Shiburingaru","img":"swsh12/113"},{"id":"swsh4-109","name":"Krookodile","set":"Vivid Voltage","date":"2020-11-13","rarity":"Rare","number":"109","artist":"Ryuta Fuse","img":"swsh4/109"},{"id":"sm10-116","name":"Krookodile","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Rare","number":"116","artist":"Anesaki Dynamic","img":"sm10/116"},{"id":"sm1-85","name":"Kro